<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Woolworths appoints finance director.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Woolworths appoints finance director.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailer Woolworths Ltd said Australis Media Ltd finance director Geoff Kleeman will join the company as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Kleeman, who will take up his position on January 7, will replace Van Gold, who resigned effective September 27.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
